style(talents): biome-format touched files and organize imports

Format-only cleanup of the files this branch changed so biome ci --changed passes;
no logic changes.

fix(i18n): rebaseline resolved-table sha256 after base merge

The committed generated tables already match a regen on the merged tree;
only the baseline hash file was stale (i18n_resolved_hash.mjs --write).

fix(scripts): remove stray em dash in gen_sfx.mjs comment

Copy scan flagged an em dash introduced upstream in release/v0.25.0;
strip it while rebasing this PR onto that base.

